---
/**
 * Marks a statement on the booking page that the team still has to confirm.
 * Remove the wrapper once it's verified (and tick it in docs/open-questions.md).
 * Shown as a small dotted underline with a note, so the page stays readable.
 */
---
<span class="confirm" title="To be confirmed by the team"><slot /><span class="tag ui">to confirm</span></span>

<style>
  .confirm {
    text-decoration: underline dotted rgb(255 255 179 / 0.45);
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
  }
  .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 0.45em;
    padding: 0 0.4em;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 179 / 0.35);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: rgb(255 255 179 / 0.75);
    vertical-align: 0.15em;
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
